<div class="dossier-kpi"><span>Prime Minister</span><b>[+ dossier_prime_minister +]</b></div>
<div class="dossier-kpi"><span>Lewica</span><b>[+ dossier_left_seats +] MPs · [+ dossier_left_poll +]%</b></div>
