[? if dossier_sejm_delta != 0: <div class="dossier-warning">The live Sejm party records differ from the chamber size by **[+ dossier_sejm_delta +]**. The chart shows the recorded party ledgers without silently reallocating MPs.</div>?]
[? if dossier_senate_delta != 0: <div class="dossier-warning">The live Senate party records differ from the chamber size by **[+ dossier_senate_delta +]**. The chart shows the recorded party ledgers without silently reallocating senators.</div>?]

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first">
<div class="ledger-title">Sejm party ledger</div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-lewica"><b>[+ dossier_left_party +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ left_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if sld_breakaway_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-sld"><b>[+ barons_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ sld_breakaway_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if social_patriot_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-social-patriot"><b>[+ social_patriot_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ social_patriot_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if spring_breakaway_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-wiosna"><b>[+ spring_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ spring_breakaway_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if labor_left_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-left-labor"><b>[+ labor_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ labor_left_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if young_left_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-progressive"><b>[+ progressives_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ young_left_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if razem_party_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-razem"><b>Razem</b></span><span></span><span>[+ razem_party_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if pps_party_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-pps"><b>PPS</b></span><span></span><span>[+ pps_party_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if tak_rozwoj_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-razem"><b>[+ tak_rozwoj_party_name +]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ tak_rozwoj_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span><span></span><span>[+ ko_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if ko_splinter_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-ko"><b>KO breakaway</b></span><span></span><span>[+ ko_splinter_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if p2050_seats > 0 and not p2050_joined_left: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-p2050"><b>Polska 2050</b></span><span></span><span>[+ p2050_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if centrum_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-centrum"><b>Unia Centrum</b></span><span></span><span>[+ centrum_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-psl"><b>PSL[? if kp_coalition_active = 1: — Koalicja Polska?]</b></span><span></span><span>[+ psl_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if kukiz_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-kukiz"><b>Kukiz'15</b></span><span></span><span>[+ kukiz_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if porozumienie_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-agreement"><b>Porozumienie</b></span><span></span><span>[+ porozumienie_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span><span></span><span>[+ pis_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if rozwoj_seats > 0 and not rozwoj_joined_left: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-rozwoj"><b>Rozwój Plus</b></span><span></span><span>[+ rozwoj_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if suwerenna_seats > 0 and not suwerenna_merged: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-sovereign-poland"><b>Suwerenna Polska</b></span><span></span><span>[+ suwerenna_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-konf"><b>Konfederacja</b></span><span></span><span>[+ konf_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if korona_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-korona"><b>Korona</b></span><span></span><span>[+ korona_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
[? if other_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span><b>Other / independent</b></span><span></span><span>[+ other_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
</div>

<div class="ledger-section">
<div class="ledger-title">Senate party ledger</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Control</span><b>[+ senate_control +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Marshal</span><b>[+ dossier_senate_marshal +]</b></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-lewica"><b>Left</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_left_seats +] seats</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_ko_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if senate_p2050_seats > 0 and not p2050_joined_left: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-p2050"><b>Polska 2050</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_p2050_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-psl"><b>PSL</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_psl_seats +] seats</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span><b>Independent</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_independent_seats +] seats</span></div>
<div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_pis_seats +] seats</span></div>
[? if senate_konf_seats > 0: <div class="poll-row"><span class="party party-konf"><b>Konfederacja</b></span><span></span><span>[+ senate_konf_seats +] seats</span></div>?]
</div>

The Sejm appoints and removes governments. The Senate reviews legislation but
does not vote on confidence. An ordinary Senate rejection or amendment can be
overridden by an absolute Sejm majority; on a budget the Senate may propose
amendments but cannot reject the act as a whole.

- @polling: Compare with projected seats
- @menu: Back to index

