</div>

Opposition can use parliamentary scrutiny, European and American democratic
channels, party diplomacy and public evidence. Government can negotiate and
implement national policy. A Left President adds representation, ratification
and convening, but not cabinet command. If EU and US relationships collapse,
the resulting loss of funds, investment and orders reaches growth and jobs in
a dated event.

- @menu: Back to index

@rules
title: Campaign rules
go-to: menu

= How the campaign works

Each month, draw from Party Affairs and—depending on Lewica's authority—from
Government Affairs, negotiation or External Affairs. All opportunities share
one three-card agenda. Play one card, use an adviser if useful, then end the
month and resolve the dated national event.

Political resources do not automatically refill every month. Adviser actions
share a cooldown. Faction dissent reduces campaign effectiveness and can grow
into public criticism, failed whips, defections and separate parties. Election
polls are sampled; the underlying intent and projected seats are shown
separately in the poll tracker.

The campaign begins after the 2019 election, can pass through the 2023 transfer
of power, and runs through the scenario horizon to the autumn 2027 Sejm and
Senate elections. A standalone 2023 formation start is also available from the
title screen.

